Error [E0911]: `drop` inside `migration` is not yet supported
  --> tests/ui/migration_unknown_op.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     drop x
    |     ^^^^
 Why: only `rename` is implemented in this release; `add`, `drop`, and type-change ops are staged behind D-MIGRATE2
 Fix: use `rename old -> new` for field renames; bump the major version for other shape changes for now
